new-page: true

= Phillip Scheidemann

Phillip Scheidemann is [? if chancellor = "Scheidemann": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Scheidemann": the current President and ?] the former Reich Minister President and the man who proclaimed the Republic.

- @expose_rearmament
- @democratic_rally
- @weimar_relations
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main

@expose_rearmament
title: Expose the secret rearmament plans of the [? if spd_in_government : previous ?] foreign ministry!
view-if: rearmament_exposed == 0
on-arrival: west_relation += 2; east_relation += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); rearmament_exposed += 1; reparations_negotiation += 3; coup_progress += 2

On the floor of the Reichstag, Scheidemann reveals that the [? if spd_in_government : previous ?] foreign ministry, despite its benevolent and peaceful face, was secretly helping the Reichswehr to build up its forces, in contravention of the Treaty of Versailles.

The Allies are grateful of our exposure and repudiation of militarism. [? if spd_in_government : Our partners in the coalition are less supportive. ?]

@democratic_rally
title: Rally for democracy
subtitle: Rally our party and the German people to defend democracy and freedom.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pro_republic += 5; democratization += 1; neorevisionist_strength += 5; reformist_strength += 3; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4

Scheidemann helps us to rally the people in defense of democracy.

@weimar_relations
title: Reach out to the Weimar parties
subtitle: Use Scheidemann's connections to reach out to the Weimar parties.
on-arrival: z_relation += 10; ddp_relation += 10

Scheidemann uses his connections to boost relations with the Zentrum and DDP.

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Scheidemann can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Scheidemann"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Scheidemann can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Scheidemann"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
